6337..6413 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6414..6488 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6489..6565 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6566..6640 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6641..6649 Comment "/// `g`."
